{"text": "A sign is like a clue God gives, so His people would know it was really Him.", "start": 145.9, "end": 150.52, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 145.9, "end": 146.02}, {"text": "sign", "start": 146.02, "end": 146.42}, {"text": "is", "start": 146.42, "end": 146.72}, {"text": "like", "start": 146.72, "end": 146.92}, {"text": "a", "start": 146.92, "end": 147.04}, {"text": "clue", "start": 147.04, "end": 147.36}, {"text": "God", "start": 147.36, "end": 147.64}, {"text": "gives,", "start": 147.64, "end": 148.06}, {"text": "so", "start": 148.3, "end": 148.52}, {"text": "His", "start": 148.52, "end": 148.68}, {"text": "people", "start": 148.68, "end": 149.02}, {"text": "would", "start": 149.02, "end": 149.26}, {"text": "know", "start": 149.26, "end": 149.5}, {"text": "it", "start": 149.5, "end": 149.68}, {"text": "was", "start": 149.68, "end": 149.86}, {"text": "really", "start": 149.86, "end": 150.22}, {"text": "Him.", "start": 150.22, "end": 150.52}]},
{"text": "Ema opened her eyes.", "start": 152.04, "end": 153.46, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 152.04, "end": 152.3}, {"text": "opened", "start": 152.3, "end": 152.76}, {"text": "her", "start": 152.76, "end": 153.0}, {"text": "eyes.", "start": 153.0, "end": 153.46}]},
{"text": "Papa was smiling at her.", "start": 154.06, "end": 155.48, "words": [{"text": "Papa", "start": 154.06, "end": 154.26}, {"text": "was", "start": 154.26, "end": 154.58}, {"text": "smiling", "start": 154.58, "end": 155.0}, {"text": "at", "start": 155.0, "end": 155.26}, {"text": "her.", "start": 155.26, "end": 155.48}]},
{"text": "\"Papa, who is Immanuel?\"", "start": 156.0, "end": 158.0, "words": [{"text": "\"Papa,", "start": 156.0, "end": 156.52}, {"text": "who", "start": 157.04, "end": 157.3}, {"text": "is", "start": 157.3, "end": 157.56}, {"text": "Immanuel?\"", "start": 157.56, "end": 158.0}]},
{"text": "\"It's Jesus,\" said Papa.", "start": 158.66, "end": 160.62, "words": [{"text": "\"It's", "start": 158.66, "end": 159.1}, {"text": "Jesus,\"", "start": 159.1, "end": 159.54}, {"text": "said", "start": 160.04, "end": 160.3}, {"text": "Papa.", "start": 160.3, "end": 160.62}]},
{"text": "\"When Jesus came as a baby, God came to be with us.", "start": 161.26, "end": 164.46, "words": [{"text": "\"When", "start": 161.26, "end": 161.38}, {"text": "Jesus", "start": 161.38, "end": 161.68}, {"text": "came", "start": 161.68, "end": 162.04}, {"text": "as", "start": 162.04, "end": 162.24}, {"text": "a", "start": 162.24, "end": 162.38}, {"text": "baby,", "start": 162.38, "end": 162.68}, {"text": "God", "start": 163.2, "end": 163.34}, {"text": "came", "start": 163.34, "end": 163.62}, {"text": "to", "start": 163.62, "end": 163.84}, {"text": "be", "start": 163.84, "end": 164.0}, {"text": "with", "start": 164.0, "end": 164.22}, {"text": "us.", "start": 164.22, "end": 164.46}]},
{"text": "Close.", "start": 164.88, "end": 165.12, "words": [{"text": "Close.", "start": 164.88, "end": 165.12}]},
{"text": "Right here.\"", "start": 165.66, "end": 166.16, "words": [{"text": "Right", "start": 165.66, "end": 165.88}, {"text": "here.\"", "start": 165.88, "end": 166.16}]},
{"text": "\"Is God with me at school?\"", "start": 166.74, "end": 168.06, "words": [{"text": "\"Is", "start": 166.74, "end": 166.88}, {"text": "God", "start": 166.88, "end": 167.16}, {"text": "with", "start": 167.16, "end": 167.4}, {"text": "me", "start": 167.4, "end": 167.56}, {"text": "at", "start": 167.56, "end": 167.7}, {"text": "school?\"", "start": 167.7, "end": 168.06}]},
{"text": "asked Ema.", "start": 168.5, "end": 169.06, "words": [{"text": "asked", "start": 168.5, "end": 168.78}, {"text": "Ema.", "start": 168.78, "end": 169.06}]},
{"text": "\"Yes,\" said Mummy.", "start": 169.62, "end": 170.66, "words": [{"text": "\"Yes,\"", "start": 169.62, "end": 169.88}, {"text": "said", "start": 170.2, "end": 170.42}, {"text": "Mummy.", "start": 170.42, "end": 170.66}]},
{"text": "\"And when you play, and when you sleep, and when you wake up in the morning.\"", "start": 171.14, "end": 174.86, "words": [{"text": "\"And", "start": 171.14, "end": 171.26}, {"text": "when", "start": 171.26, "end": 171.4}, {"text": "you", "start": 171.4, "end": 171.56}, {"text": "play,", "start": 171.56, "end": 171.94}, {"text": "and", "start": 172.36, "end": 172.46}, {"text": "when", "start": 172.46, "end": 172.6}, {"text": "you", "start": 172.6, "end": 172.74}, {"text": "sleep,", "start": 172.74, "end": 173.12}, {"text": "and", "start": 173.5, "end": 173.74}, {"text": "when", "start": 173.74, "end": 173.92}, {"text": "you", "start": 173.92, "end": 174.04}, {"text": "wake", "start": 174.04, "end": 174.2}, {"text": "up", "start": 174.2, "end": 174.4}, {"text": "in", "start": 174.4, "end": 174.52}, {"text": "the", "start": 174.52, "end": 174.6}, {"text": "morning.\"", "start": 174.6, "end": 174.86}]},
{"text": "Where else is God with you, little one?", "start": 175.44, "end": 177.06, "words": [{"text": "Where", "start": 175.44, "end": 175.6}, {"text": "else", "start": 175.6, "end": 175.88}, {"text": "is", "start": 175.88, "end": 176.02}, {"text": "God", "start": 176.02, "end": 176.22}, {"text": "with", "start": 176.22, "end": 176.44}, {"text": "you,", "start": 176.44, "end": 176.6}, {"text": "little", "start": 176.68, "end": 176.82}, {"text": "one?", "start": 176.82, "end": 177.06}]},
{"text": "At the park?", "start": 177.48, "end": 177.96, "words": [{"text": "At", "start": 177.48, "end": 177.62}, {"text": "the", "start": 177.62, "end": 177.72}, {"text": "park?", "start": 177.72, "end": 177.96}]},
{"text": "At Oma's house?", "start": 178.46, "end": 179.2, "words": [{"text": "At", "start": 178.46, "end": 178.66}, {"text": "Oma's", "start": 178.66, "end": 179.04}, {"text": "house?", "start": 179.04, "end": 179.2}]},
{"text": "In your bed right now?", "start": 179.68, "end": 180.68, "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 179.68, "end": 179.84}, {"text": "your", "start": 179.84, "end": 179.94}, {"text": "bed", "start": 179.94, "end": 180.18}, {"text": "right", "start": 180.18, "end": 180.42}, {"text": "now?", "start": 180.42, "end": 180.68}]},
{"text": "Yes.", "start": 182.8, "end": 183.44, "words": [{"text": "Yes.", "start": 182.8, "end": 183.44}]},
{"text": "Everywhere.", "start": 184.02, "end": 184.6, "words": [{"text": "Everywhere.", "start": 184.02, "end": 184.6}]},
{"text": "God is with us.", "start": 185.24, "end": 186.22, "words": [{"text": "God", "start": 185.24, "end": 185.56}, {"text": "is", "start": 185.56, "end": 185.76}, {"text": "with", "start": 185.76, "end": 185.98}, {"text": "us.", "start": 185.98, "end": 186.22}]},
{"text": "You know, little one…", "start": 188.56, "end": 189.92, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 188.56, "end": 188.9}, {"text": "know,", "start": 188.9, "end": 189.12}, {"text": "little", "start": 189.4, "end": 189.6}, {"text": "one…", "start": 189.6, "end": 189.92}]},
{"text": "you are never alone.", "start": 190.46, "end": 191.68, "words": [{"text": "you", "start": 190.46, "end": 190.66}, {"text": "are", "start": 190.66, "end": 190.8}, {"text": "never", "start": 190.8, "end": 191.18}, {"text": "alone.", "start": 191.18, "end": 191.68}]},
{"text": "Not in the day, and not in the night.", "start": 192.24, "end": 194.4, "words": [{"text": "Not", "start": 192.24, "end": 192.46}, {"text": "in", "start": 192.46, "end": 192.62}, {"text": "the", "start": 192.62, "end": 192.72}, {"text": "day,", "start": 192.72, "end": 193.02}, {"text": "and", "start": 193.02, "end": 193.58}, {"text": "not", "start": 193.58, "end": 193.8}, {"text": "in", "start": 193.8, "end": 193.94}, {"text": "the", "start": 193.94, "end": 194.04}, {"text": "night.", "start": 194.04, "end": 194.4}]},
{"text": "Jesus is Immanuel…", "start": 194.8, "end": 196.32, "words": [{"text": "Jesus", "start": 194.8, "end": 195.28}, {"text": "is", "start": 195.28, "end": 195.78}, {"text": "Immanuel…", "start": 195.78, "end": 196.32}]},
{"text": "God with us.", "start": 196.84, "end": 197.7, "words": [{"text": "God", "start": 196.84, "end": 197.14}, {"text": "with", "start": 197.14, "end": 197.42}, {"text": "us.", "start": 197.42, "end": 197.7}]},
{"text": "Tomorrow, when you wake up, you can whisper, \"Good morning, Jesus.", "start": 198.44, "end": 202.3, "words": [{"text": "Tomorrow,", "start": 198.44, "end": 198.8}, {"text": "when", "start": 199.2, "end": 199.38}, {"text": "you", "start": 199.38, "end": 199.5}, {"text": "wake", "start": 199.5, "end": 199.7}, {"text": "up,", "start": 199.7, "end": 199.98}, {"text": "you", "start": 200.36, "end": 200.46}, {"text": "can", "start": 200.46, "end": 200.62}, {"text": "whisper,", "start": 200.62, "end": 200.96}, {"text": "\"Good", "start": 201.48, "end": 201.58}, {"text": "morning,", "start": 201.58, "end": 201.88}, {"text": "Jesus.", "start": 202.18, "end": 202.3}]},
{"text": "You're with me.\"", "start": 202.9, "end": 203.54, "words": [{"text": "You're", "start": 202.9, "end": 203.08}, {"text": "with", "start": 203.08, "end": 203.3}, {"text": "me.\"", "start": 203.3, "end": 203.54}]},
{"text": "Ema held Mummy's hand on one side, and Papa's hand on the other.", "start": 204.18, "end": 207.94, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 204.18, "end": 204.44}, {"text": "held", "start": 204.44, "end": 204.76}, {"text": "Mummy's", "start": 204.76, "end": 205.26}, {"text": "hand", "start": 205.26, "end": 205.42}, {"text": "on", "start": 205.42, "end": 205.6}, {"text": "one", "start": 205.6, "end": 205.82}, {"text": "side,", "start": 205.82, "end": 206.2}, {"text": "and", "start": 206.2, "end": 206.62}, {"text": "Papa's", "start": 206.62, "end": 207.08}, {"text": "hand", "start": 207.08, "end": 207.3}, {"text": "on", "start": 207.3, "end": 207.5}, {"text": "the", "start": 207.5, "end": 207.7}, {"text": "other.", "start": 207.7, "end": 207.94}]},
{"text": "Let's pray.", "start": 209.58, "end": 210.44, "words": [{"text": "Let's", "start": 209.58, "end": 210.16}, {"text": "pray.", "start": 210.16, "end": 210.44}]},
{"text": "Dear Jesus…", "start": 211.22, "end": 211.78, "words": [{"text": "Dear", "start": 211.22, "end": 211.34}, {"text": "Jesus…", "start": 211.34, "end": 211.78}]},
{"text": "thank You for always being with us.", "start": 212.48, "end": 214.46, "words": [{"text": "thank", "start": 212.48, "end": 212.66}, {"text": "You", "start": 212.66, "end": 212.88}, {"text": "for", "start": 212.88, "end": 213.08}, {"text": "always", "start": 213.08, "end": 213.6}, {"text": "being", "start": 213.6, "end": 213.92}, {"text": "with", "start": 213.92, "end": 214.2}, {"text": "us.", "start": 214.2, "end": 214.46}]},
{"text": "Thank You that I am never alone.", "start": 214.78, "end": 216.76, "words": [{"text": "Thank", "start": 214.78, "end": 215.12}, {"text": "You", "start": 215.12, "end": 215.42}, {"text": "that", "start": 215.42, "end": 215.62}, {"text": "I", "start": 215.62, "end": 215.82}, {"text": "am", "start": 215.82, "end": 215.96}, {"text": "never", "start": 215.96, "end": 216.34}, {"text": "alone.", "start": 216.34, "end": 216.76}]},
{"text": "Amen.", "start": 216.76, "end": 217.58, "words": [{"text": "Amen.", "start": 216.76, "end": 217.58}]},
{"text": "Goodnight, little light.", "start": 218.58, "end": 219.64, "words": [{"text": "Goodnight,", "start": 218.58, "end": 219.04}, {"text": "little", "start": 219.22, "end": 219.3}, {"text": "light.", "start": 219.3, "end": 219.64}]},
{"text": "Sleep tight.", "start": 220.26, "end": 220.72, "words": [{"text": "Sleep", "start": 220.26, "end": 220.38}, {"text": "tight.", "start": 220.38, "end": 220.72}]},
{"text": "Twenty-two more nights to go.", "start": 221.24, "end": 222.78, "words": [{"text": "Twenty-two", "start": 221.24, "end": 221.84}, {"text": "more", "start": 221.84, "end": 222.06}, {"text": "nights", "start": 222.06, "end": 222.3}, {"text": "to", "start": 222.3, "end": 222.56}, {"text": "go.", "start": 222.56, "end": 222.78}]}
]
